  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Amazon Catalyst for Forest Communities (AMCAT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Amazon Catalyst for Forest Communities (AMCAT) will invest up to &#xa3;94 million of UK ODA over six years (2025-2030) to strengthen the forest governance and forest tenure security of Indigenous People and local communities (IPLC) across the Amazon Basin. It will work directly with IPLC organisations in up to eight Amazon countries, and catalyse further action across the region strengthening knowledge and influence and enabling groups to secure additional finance to magnify impact regionwide.</narrative>
  </description>
